{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121908","id":4163743004,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc74La0c","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121908","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121908.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121908.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121908","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121908/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121908/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121908/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/fcd37006f6045531c7d63baab0ccfad0ce42d394","number":121908,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix `SignalsDock` tree not updating","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nFixes a regression from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116490\r\nShader editor document list error icon was not being updated immediately on validation, I forgot to remove the if statement so the signal connects for shaders too.\r\n<img width=\"202\" height=\"25\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/22e035a9-7eb0-43b1-bef2-b03e0dfe3881\" />\r\n\r\nAlso updated the signal and function name.\r\n\r\n- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/37783\r\n\r\nThe SignalsDock tree was updating when any script validation updated, not just the one in cares about.\r\nIt was not updating when script attached/detached.\r\nIt was not updating when external editor changed the signals.\r\n(These weren't part of the regression, I just happened to fix them when trying to find a better place for the Signals update from ScriptEditor).\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nCopied the signal connection logic from EditorInspector, not sure if this needs the `get_validated_object`, but I figured its safer to have it.\r\n\r\nThere is still one use of `SignalsDock::update_lists()` in C# code so I didn't remove it. Not sure if it is still needed or not since IDK why it was updating for the inspector too.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":fals